ng provider of fleet and mobile asset management solutions.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2a674cb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Founded in 2011, we provide Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) for fleet management, workshop management, and IoT smart solutions that improve safety, security, and productivity.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fe9e2e7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Address: Plot 7, Mundeka Road, Bugolobi, Balenzi Building, 1st Floor, P.O. Box 2359, Kampala, Uganda</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "86ac331", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Email: customersupport@smartwatchsolutions.com</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c6e8ca3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "403a983", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Your privacy", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "867b304", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We respect your privacy and only collect the information we need to make our website work better for you.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3b688d1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "de503c1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Here's what we do:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4f3bc9f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>We collect information only by fair and lawful means.</li><li>We explain why we collect it before or when we do.</li><li>We use it only for the reason we collected it.</li><li>We keep it safe and protect it from unauthorised access.</li><li>We keep it only for as long as needed to serve you better.</li></ul>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-bullets", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "16792cb", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "cccb63d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cookies: what they are", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b5f297d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Like most websites, we use cookies.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ddb0dc6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help the website remember your preferences and improve your browsing experience.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ea6f18c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Some cookies are essential for the website to work, while others help us understand how visitors use our site.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "6159c37", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "ccf18bf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "How we use cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5eb5a8f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>These cookies help us make our website more useful and relevant to you. We use cookies to:</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3834d08", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Remember your settings and preferences (like language or login).</li><li>Improve website performance and user experience.</li><li>Understand how visitors interact with our site using analytics tools.</li></ul>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-bullets", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "5ca8cb8", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "855652b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Managing or turning off cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "12e2b39", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You can choose to accept or reject cookies through your browser settings.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "daf7ea7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>If you turn them off, some parts of the site may not work properly, but you'll still be able to browse most of it.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f4dec10", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>You can learn how to manage cookies in your browser's Help section.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2f83f01", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "flex_wrap": "nowrap", "content_width": "full", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 12, "column": "12", "row": "12", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "css_classes": "sw-legal-section"}, "elements": [{"id": "471c8e7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Third-party cookies", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-h", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=swh3", "title_color": "globals/colors?id=swheading"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "43610cb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>We may use trusted third-party tools like Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our website and improve our services.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8c8fa7a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>These tools collect anonymous usage data, not your personal details. You can learn more at the official Google Analytics privacy page.</p>", "_css_classes": "sw-legal-p", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=text", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=text"}}, "elements"